{"id":"11ad5a1f324e7f83","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity.md","title":"模幂按位数计为多项式时间","display":"thm-modular-power-bit-complexity — 模幂按位数计为多项式时间","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity","aliases":["73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity"],"display":"thm-modular-power-bit-complexity — 模幂按位数计为多项式时间","depends_on":["[[73-df-modular-exponentiation]]","[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.3, print pp. 516–517; PDF pp. 538–539; local total-function extension","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modular-power-bit-complexity — 模幂按位数计为多项式时间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b39bd6838766ad96\" href=\"?note=b39bd6838766ad96\" title=\"73-df-modular-exponentiation\">73-df-modular-exponentiation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.3, print pp. 516–517; PDF pp. 538–539; local total-function extension"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；输入输出编码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FP}\">\\(\\mathsf{FP}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a> 定义的总多项式时间二进制词函数类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的合法输入为三项自然数列表编码，其他词返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bin}(0)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bin}(0)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e))\\quad(n\\ge2),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(0)\\quad\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ a,e\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e))\\quad(n\\ge2),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(0)\\quad\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ a,e\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathsf{FP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathsf{FP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先把 a 对 n 取余，之后中间数最多约两倍模数位长。指数的每个二进制位只触发常数次乘法和除法；学校式整数运算已有多项式位复杂度。关键变量是 |Bin(n)|+|Bin(a)|+|Bin(e)|，不是 n 或 e 的数值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-modular-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"b39bd6838766ad96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$a,e\\in\\mathbb N$；输入输出编码取 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。$\\mathsf{FP}$ 是 [[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]] 定义的总多项式时间二进制词函数类，$f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*$，$w\\in\\mathbf2^*$。下式 $f$ 的合法输入为三项自然数列表编码，其他词返回 $\\operatorname{Bin}(0)$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$a,e\\in\\mathbb N$；输入输出编码取 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。$\\mathsf{FP}$ 是 [[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]] 定义的总多项式时间二进制词函数类，$f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*$，$w\\in\\mathbf2^*$。下式 $f$ 的合法输入为三项自然数列表编码，其他词返回 $\\operatorname{Bin}(0)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"a,e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bin}(0)","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e))\\quad(n\\ge2),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bin}(0)\\quad\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\langle n,a,e\\rangle):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ a,e\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathsf{FP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1791,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity|模幂按位数计为多项式时间]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"cfebf3d79d57531c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b39bd6838766ad96","0173e0f8c9568f2f","bc88ca69b33d5036"]}